      "content": "HIGH STREET 1. 967                                            (West side) \t\t\t\t\t   No 132                                            \t   (Formerly listed as                                        \t   Beverley House) SP 9601 NW 3/58           10.11.51. II 2.                                            C18.  Red brick, mansard tiled roof. 2 storeys and attics.  3 sash windows with glazing bars in reveals, central window over doorway round arched, 3 light side windows flat arched.  2 sash box dormers.  Door and traceried fanlight in surround of part panelled, part fluted pilasters under entablatures, with dentil cornices, triglyph and oval medallion friezes, under open pediment. Listing NGR: SP9602601869"
